ext tokens only (output explicitly out of scope, no model call), runs multi-target, and flags each scenario `fair` vs `worst-case` — the headline excludes strawman baselines so it can't be inflated. Outputs `dist/token_audit_v2.json`.\n\n**Decisions:** count_tokens-only (zero spend); rebuild harness first, then the `/review` page (Phase 2). `@anthropic-ai/sdk` is installed in `mcp-server/`. **Blocked on:** `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` not set — needed to run v2. Frontend runs on :5175 (`agent-os-dashboard/client`, `npm run dev`), backend on :3030. Related: [[project_binary16_app_registry]], [[benny_pilot_documents_and_no_selection_fix]].\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":4,"newStart":13,"newLines":6,"lines":[" "," **What I built:** `mcp-server/run_benchmark_v2.js` — counts both arms' real payloads with Anthropic `count_tokens` (`POST /v1/messages/count_tokens`, exact, free, model=`claude-opus-4-8` by default), removes all injected constants, measures input/context tokens only (output explicitly out of scope, no model call), runs multi-target, and flags each scenario `fair` vs `worst-case` — the headline excludes strawman baselines so it can't be inflated. Outputs `dist/token_audit_v2.json`."," ","-**Decisions:** count_tokens-only (zero spend); rebuild harness first, then the `/review` page (Phase 2). `@anthropic-ai/sdk` is installed in `mcp-server/`. **Blocked on:** `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` not set — needed to run v2. Frontend runs on :5175 (`agent-os-dashboard/client`, `npm run dev`), backend on :3030. Related: [[project_binary16_app_registry]], [[benny_pilot_documents_and_no_selection_fix]].","+**Dual-mode (subscriber-friendly):** `mcp-server/tokenizer.js` `makeCounter()` — offline by default via `@anthropic-ai/tokenizer` (real legacy Claude BPE, NO key, zero spend, runs against live local data) and exact `count_tokens` API when `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` is set (`TOKENIZER=offline|api` forces). Both `@anthropic-ai/sdk` and `@anthropic-ai/tokenizer` installed in `mcp-server/`.","+","+**Validated (offline, 2026-06-25)** → `dist/token_audit_v2.json`. Headline (FAIR scenarios only, strawman excluded): **40.6% input-token reduction** (149,818→88,962). Per scenario: Get Latest Session 90.0%, Sliding Window 75.8%, Reconstruct Full Timeline **3.4% (control — MCP barely helps when you genuinely need all history; v1 hid this)**, Query-by-Project 94.0% but flagged worst-case/strawman and excluded. Conclusion: claim holds DIRECTIONALLY and is large for summary-shaped queries, ~0 for full-history. Re-run with key for exact numbers. NB: data-reader.js:216 also uses length/4 for its graph token estimates. Next: Phase 2 `/review` page rendering this JSON. Frontend :5175, backend :3030. Related: [[project_binary16_app_registry]], [[benny_pilot_documents_and_no_selection_fix]]."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b8d087a6-8edc-4313-9a49-b8e9585a41c8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\memo-ray","sessionId":"101cdbf9-13c9-4450-a0b5-a384b75b301d","version":"2.1.181","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"55424b2f-4653-4f4a-b135-5bce07250137","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01LBVgDU5dzmgF72GtSxxRzQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Yes — it now runs with no API key, and the claim is validated\n\nThe audit just ran entirely **offline against your live local memo-ray data** using a real Claude BPE tokenizer (`@anthropic-ai/tokenizer`) — no key, no spend, no network. The API path still exists as an optional upgrade.\n\n**How it picks a mode** ([tokenizer.js](memo-ray/mcp-server/tokenizer.js)):\n- **No key → offline** (default, subscriber-friendly). Real Claude tokenizer, fully local.\n- **`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` set → exact** `count_tokens`. Force either with `TOKENIZER=offline|api`.\n\n### The real numbers (offline run)\n\n| Scenario | Baseline | no-MCP | MCP | Reduction |\n|---|---|--:|--:|--:|\n| Get Latest Session | fair | 3,104 | 309 | **90.0%** |\n| Sliding Window (last 50) | fair | 73,357 | 17,767 | **75.8%** |\n| Reconstruct Full Timeline | fair (control) | 73,357 | 70,886 | **3.4%** |\n| Query by Project | ⚠ worst-case | 28,848 | 1,724 | 94.0% *(excluded)* |\n\n**Headline (fair scenarios only, strawman excluded): 40.6% input-token reduction.**\n\n### What this tells us about the claim\n- **It holds — directionally and substantially — but only for summary-shaped queries.** When the agent needs a *digest* (latest session, a bounded window), the MCP layer cuts 75–90% of context tokens. That's the legitimate core of the \"Token Tax\" thesis.\n- **It is honest about where it doesn't help.** Full-timeline reconstruction saves only **3.4%** — because when you genuinely need every event, there's nothing to compress. v1 buried exactly this case inside its 51% aggregate; v2 surfaces it as the control.\n- **The strawman is quarantined.** The 94% \"query by project\" win comes from a no-MCP baseline that loads every entity from disk — not what a real agent does — so it's reported but kept out of the headline.\n\nNet: the published ~51% number was inflated by a fake tokenizer + injected constants; the **defensible, key-free number is ~41%**, with an honest per-scenario breakdown. Set a key later and re-run for the exact-tokenizer version — the structure won't change, only the precise digits.\n\nOutput is in [dist/token_audit_v2.json](memo-ray/dist/token_audit_v2.json), and the frontend is live at http://localhost:5175/.\n\nNext up is Phase 2: the `/review` page (currently 404) that renders this JSON with the methodology and the fair/worst-case split visible. Want me to build that now?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1240,"cache_read_input_tokens":312114,"output_tokens":939,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1240,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":939,"cache_read_input_tokens":312114,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1240,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1240},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcPpqnv77Ym5Jis5HL9YP","type":"assistant","uuid":"4386b948-7c28-478f-abbf-1057d02828b9","timestamp":"2026-06-25T10:32:44.069Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\memo-ray","sessionId":"101cdbf9-13c9-4450-a0b5-a384b75b301d","version":"2.1.181","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
